+  // All other providers (deepseek, google, groq, together, etc.) rely on
+  // process.env, which may not reach subprocesses (e.g. Hermes spawning gbrain
+  // via s6-overlay — the gateway process has an empty env). This generic
+  // mapping folds any config key matching *_api_key into its uppercase
+  // *_API_KEY env var, so any provider key written to the config file reaches
